<td id="A2.T6.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t">
<span id="A2.T6.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T6.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T6.2.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Given an image of a chart, your task is to generate a question and a corresponding reference answer, following the specific instructions below.
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">Instruction for Generation:
