<span id="A2.T8.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T8.2.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Given an image of a chart, your task is to generate a question and a corresponding reference answer, following the specific instructions below.
